  "title": "Jomama&#39;s Big Game Dip",
  "description": "Canned shrimp, plenty of Cheddar cheese, and salsa flavor this fun layered dip. It&#39;s great for the big game. Best served with thin crisp wheat crackers.",
  "authors": [
